IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-ACHRECV.
*> ================================================================
*> TEST-ACHRECV - Test suite for ACH Incoming File Processor
*> Tests: ACH credits, debits, returns, batch validation,
*>        edge cases, overflow, OFAC screening (36 tests)
*> ================================================================

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TEST-COUNT          PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  WS-PASS-COUNT          PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  WS-FAIL-COUNT          PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  WS-TEST-NAME           PIC X(60).
01  WS-EXPECTED-AVAIL-BAL  PIC S9(13)V99.

*> ACH Entry (replicate LS-ACH-ENTRY from ACHRECV0)
01  WS-ACH-ENTRY.
    05  WS-ACH-RECORD-TYPE       PIC X(1).
    05  WS-ACH-TXN-CODE          PIC 9(2).
    05  WS-ACH-ROUTING-NUM       PIC 9(9).
    05  WS-ACH-ACCT-NUMBER       PIC X(17).
    05  WS-ACH-AMOUNT            PIC S9(13)V99.
    05  WS-ACH-INDIV-NAME        PIC X(22).
    05  WS-ACH-TRACE-NUMBER      PIC X(15).
    05  WS-ACH-ADDENDA-FLAG      PIC X(1).
    05  WS-ACH-BATCH-COUNT       PIC 9(6).
    05  WS-ACH-BATCH-DR-TOTAL    PIC S9(13)V99.
    05  WS-ACH-BATCH-CR-TOTAL    PIC S9(13)V99.
    05  WS-ACH-BATCH-HASH        PIC 9(10).

*> Account record from copybook
COPY CPYACCT REPLACING ==ACCT-RECORD== BY ==WS-ACCT-RECORD==.

*> ACH Return Info (replicate LS-ACH-RETURN-INFO)
01  WS-ACH-RETURN-INFO.
    05  WS-ACH-RETURN-CODE       PIC X(3).
    05  WS-ACH-RETURN-REASON     PIC X(30).
    05  WS-ACH-RETURN-FLAG       PIC X(1).

*> ACH Result (replicate LS-ACH-RESULT)
01  WS-ACH-RESULT.
    05  WS-ACH-RESULT-CODE       PIC X(5).
    05  WS-ACH-RESULT-MSG        PIC X(50).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PROGRAM.
    DISPLAY "========================================".
    DISPLAY "TEST SUITE: ACH RECEIVE".
    DISPLAY "========================================".

    PERFORM TEST-AR-001
    PERFORM TEST-AR-002
    PERFORM TEST-AR-003
    PERFORM TEST-AR-004
    PERFORM TEST-AR-005
    PERFORM TEST-AR-006
    PERFORM TEST-AR-007
    PERFORM TEST-AR-008
    PERFORM TEST-AR-009
    PERFORM TEST-AR-010
    PERFORM TEST-AR-011
    PERFORM TEST-AR-012
    PERFORM TEST-AR-013
    PERFORM TEST-AR-014
    PERFORM TEST-AR-015
    PERFORM TEST-AR-016
    PERFORM TEST-AR-017
    PERFORM TEST-AR-018
    PERFORM TEST-AR-019
    PERFORM TEST-AR-020
    PERFORM TEST-AR-021
    PERFORM TEST-AR-022
    PERFORM TEST-AR-023
    PERFORM TEST-AR-024
    PERFORM TEST-AR-025
    PERFORM TEST-AR-026
    PERFORM TEST-AR-027
    PERFORM TEST-AR-028
    PERFORM TEST-AR-029
    PERFORM TEST-AR-030
    PERFORM TEST-AR-031
    PERFORM TEST-AR-032
    PERFORM TEST-AR-033
    PERFORM TEST-AR-034
    PERFORM TEST-AR-035
    PERFORM TEST-AR-036
    PERFORM TEST-AR-037
    PERFORM TEST-AR-038

    DISPLAY "========================================".
    DISPLAY "RESULTS: " WS-PASS-COUNT "/" WS-TEST-COUNT
            " PASSED".
    DISPLAY "         " WS-FAIL-COUNT " FAILED".
    DISPLAY "========================================".
    MOVE WS-FAIL-COUNT TO RETURN-CODE
